    <VI_Package_Configuration_File>NATS Client Toolkit.vipc</VI_Package_Configuration_File>
    <Description>
      <One_Line_Description_Summary>NATS.io Client Toolkit</One_Line_Description_Summary>
      <Description>This toolkit extends nats.lv providing:

A client daemon with queue based subscriptions for easy integration into common LabVIEW project frameworks.

See Examples for help getting started:

DMC\NATS Client Toolkit:

1. Publish Subscribe Example
2. Request Response Example</Description>
      <Copyright>Copyright (c) 2026, Andy Corbato</Copyright>
      <Packager>Andy Corbato</Packager>
      <URL>https://github.com/andycorb/nats-client-toolkit</URL>
      <Release_Notes>Initial release of the package. 

NATS Client.lvclass - a unified reader capable of supporting multiple subscriptions (daemon) and providing a request response API.s

NATS Subscription.lvclass - queue based subscriptions</Release_Notes>
    </Description>
